{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/extras/about.gif?t=1745260000\" />You have recently begun working as an <strong>apprentice burial washer</strong>, learning the sacred rituals of preparing the deceased for their final journey. Under the guidance of an experienced ritual worker, you carefully wash, purify, and shroud each body, following tradition with precision and deep respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But now, you must carry out the task alone. The bodies keep arriving, and with no one to correct your mistakes, the weight of responsibility grows heavier. A single misstep could disrupt the ritual and lead to consequences beyond your understanding.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/extras/key.gif?t=1745260000\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perform traditional burial rituals</strong> by washing, soaping, wrapping, and applying rose water to the deceased.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve ritual-based puzzles</strong> where each step must be completed correctly to honor the dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use an interactive inventory system</strong> to collect, combine, and use items like sponges, soap, and shrouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Examine objects and interact with your surroundings</strong> to uncover hidden details and progress through tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Encounter lifelike NPCs and realistic models</strong> that enhance immersion and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience psychological tension</strong> as exhaustion, isolation, and an unsettling presence take hold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover a hidden mystery</strong>; the deeper you go, the more you realize something isn\u2019t right.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590040?t=1745260000","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590040?t=1745260000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/859ccf73a7d5fd22c705862de043f143d73967c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745260000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/859ccf73a7d5fd22c705862de043f143d73967c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745260000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing imagery, themes of death, handling of deceased bodies, psychological horror elements, self-harm, and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/extras/about.gif?t=1745260000\" />You have recently begun working as an <strong>apprentice burial washer</strong>, learning the sacred rituals of preparing the deceased for their final journey. Under the guidance of an experienced ritual worker, you carefully wash, purify, and shroud each body, following tradition with precision and deep respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But now, you must carry out the task alone. The bodies keep arriving, and with no one to correct your mistakes, the weight of responsibility grows heavier. A single misstep could disrupt the ritual and lead to consequences beyond your understanding.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/extras/key.gif?t=1745260000\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perform traditional burial rituals</strong> by washing, soaping, wrapping, and applying rose water to the deceased.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve ritual-based puzzles</strong> where each step must be completed correctly to honor the dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use an interactive inventory system</strong> to collect, combine, and use items like sponges, soap, and shrouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Examine objects and interact with your surroundings</strong> to uncover hidden details and progress through tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Encounter lifelike NPCs and realistic models</strong> that enhance immersion and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience psychological tension</strong> as exhaustion, isolation, and an unsettling presence take hold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover a hidden mystery</strong>; the deeper you go, the more you realize something isn\u2019t right.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["CEMSON Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590040/d5c12e88a1e6459a3a4b8adf59a7369182908009/header.jpg?t=1745260000","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113038,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113038/movie480.mp4?t=1742253542","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113038/movie_max.mp4?t=1742253542"},"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113038/ff70643a56397860d6b9fcd200bc56cfd1fc5a9e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742253542","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113038/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742253542","max":"http://video.akamai.steamsta